# Import/Export block at the end of the Shortcuts page. Never press Apply changes. Export only into /tmp.
ipc panels settings shortcuts
wait 2
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 60
wait 1
shot ie
note IE1 same rows and footer as QML (footer depends on whether zenity/kdialog are installed). Read y of buttons from this shot.
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 glide 1100 600 100 click
wait 1
shot ie-import
note IE2 Import from end4: a preview group or an error in both shells; "Show all N" / "See skipped" when there are more. Click position is a guess. Cancel/Close afterwards.
# Gestures page
ipc panels settings mouse/gestures
wait 2
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 60
wait 1
shot ie-gestures
note Gestures page: the same block but only one section and no "Everything" row.
# MANUAL: IE2 press Cancel/Close in the preview
# MANUAL: IE3 (only when footer says to install zenity/kdialog) click Import... on Your shortcuts and type at once; QML: the text lands in the field (batch 3: the path field takes the caret as it appears)
# MANUAL: IE4 type /nonexistent.json + Enter in the path field: "Couldn't import or export" with "Couldn't read /nonexistent.json"; hover the x 1 s for tooltip "Dismiss"; click it and it goes
ipc panels close
